# Markdown outside the frontend (README, CHANGELOG, docs/, crate READMEs) is
# hand-written prose that has never been Prettier-formatted, so it is excluded
# on purpose rather than left to drift against a check nobody runs. The
# frontend keeps its own .prettierignore and `npm run format` gate; this file
# only applies when Prettier is run from the repository root.
# Verified by scripts/tests/prettier_ignore_test.sh.
*.md
!frontend/**/*.md
